              "text": "The origin of দাঁড়ানো (dā̃ṛāno) (dāṁṛāno) is not settled. CDIAL has no entry for the verb; under Sanskrit daṇḍa, \"stick\", a word it thinks probably non-Aryan, it lists Bengali dāṁṛā, \"stick, backbone\" (CDIAL 6128), but it does not connect the two."
